# Environment Variables

## Required Variables

### Database
MONGO_URI=mongodb+srv://your-connection-string
MONGO_URI_DEV=mongodb://localhost:27017/mycircle

# Connection pool tuning (optional; defaults shown)
# MONGO_MAX_POOL_SIZE=50
# MONGO_MIN_POOL_SIZE=5
# MONGO_SERVER_SELECTION_TIMEOUT_MS=5000
# MONGO_SOCKET_TIMEOUT_MS=45000
# MONGO_MAX_IDLE_TIME_MS=30000

### Authentication
JWT_SECRET=your-super-secret-jwt-key-min-32-characters
JWT_EXPIRY=30d
# Refresh-token lifetime (POST /auth/refresh rotates token pairs)
JWT_REFRESH_EXPIRY=60d
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=your-google-client-secret
GOOGLE_ANDROID_CLIENT_ID=your-android-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
GOOGLE_IOS_CLIENT_ID=your-ios-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com

### Cloudinary (Image Upload)
CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=your-cloud-name
CLOUDINARY_API_KEY=your-api-key
CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET=your-api-secret

### Payments
# Razorpay (UPI/card checkout). Without these the server runs a mock gateway
# that auto-succeeds — mock mode is hard-disabled when NODE_ENV=production.
RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=your-razorpay-key-id
RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=your-razorpay-key-secret
# Stripe (wallet top-ups / connect payouts, optional)
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=your-stripe-secret-key

## Optional Variables

### AI Features (Groq)
GROQ_API_KEY=your-groq-api-key

### Background jobs (optional)
# Leave unset to run without Redis; BullMQ queues are disabled automatically.
# REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379

# Cron (post expiry, chat cleanup, archival). Runs in-process by default.
# Set to false on all but one instance when scaling the server horizontally.
ENABLE_CRON=true

### Application
NODE_ENV=development
SERVICE_NAME=api
PORT=5000
CLIENT_URL=https://mycircle.app
CLIENT_URL_DEV=http://localhost:5173

# Comma-separated origins allowed in production CORS/Socket.io (example)
# CORS_ORIGINS=https://yourdomain.com,https://www.yourdomain.com
CORS_ORIGINS=

# Optional extracted-service adapters
# SERVICE_TIMEOUT_MS=3000
# IDENTITY_SERVICE_URL=http://identity:4001
# MARKETPLACE_SERVICE_URL=http://marketplace:4002
# CONTACT_SERVICE_URL=http://contact:4003
# COMMUNICATION_SERVICE_URL=http://communication:4004
# SAFETY_SERVICE_URL=http://safety:4005
# NOTIFICATIONS_SERVICE_URL=http://notifications:4006
# PAYMENT_SERVICE_URL=http://payment:4007

## Notes

- Never commit the actual .env file to version control
- Use strong, unique values for JWT_SECRET (minimum 32 characters)
- Get Google OAuth credentials from https://console.cloud.google.com
- Get Cloudinary credentials from https://cloudinary.com
- Get Groq API key from https://console.groq.com
- Get Razorpay credentials from https://dashboard.razorpay.com

### Firebase Admin SDK (Server)
FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=your-project-id
FIREBASE_CLIENT_EMAIL=your-client-email
FIREBASE_PRIVATE_KEY="your-private-key"
